806 validated systemic-therapy line episodes in 577 HCC patients, triangulated across three independent sources (med_orders, med_admin via medication_name, Beacon treatment_plan_orders) with per-order ICD-10 indication screening. Algorithm A vs Algorithm B+ line-assignment concordance: 97.1% at 1L, 94.8% at 2L. All 15 hard invariants PASS.

